title Team Lunch Ordering

component lunch-webapp as "Lunch Webapp" web-application
component lunch-api as "Lunch API" service
component lunch-db as "Lunch DB" database

east team-auth as "Thunder Auth (Google Workspace SSO)" identity-server
south slack as "Slack" service

north -> lunch-webapp

lunch-webapp -> lunch-api
lunch-webapp -> team-auth
lunch-api -> team-auth
lunch-api -> lunch-db
lunch-api -> slack
